        {
          "text": "Masinyane emva kokuhlupheka kwalezonsuku ilanga lizakufiphala, lenyanga kayiyikukhanya, lenkanyezi zizakuwa ezulwini, lamandla ezulu azakuzanyazanyiswa.",
